{"seq":2,"slug":"diagnostics","title":"诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/language-features/diagnostics","wordCount":1028,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"诊断\">诊断</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>诊断是把服务端的分析结果<strong>反馈到编辑器界面</strong>的通道：错误显示红色波浪线、警告显示黄色波浪线、废弃 API 显示删除线。围绕「谁来发起」这个核心问题，LSP 提供了两种方向相反的模式，理解它们的取舍是理解诊断的关键。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>发起方</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>关键机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>推送模式</td>\n<td>服务端</td>\n<td>小项目、实时反馈</td>\n<td>publishDiagnostics 通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拉取模式</td>\n<td>客户端</td>\n<td>大项目、计算密集型</td>\n<td>resultId 增量更新</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两种模式共享同一套 <code>Diagnostic</code> 数据结构，只是在「何时计算、谁来索要」上做出不同权衡；<code>tags</code> 和 <code>relatedInformation</code> 则是对诊断结果的语义增强。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推送模式-publishdiagnostics\">推送模式（publishDiagnostics）</h2><p>诊断是语言服务器向编辑器报告错误、警告和提示的核心机制。传统的推送模式中，服务端在分析完成后主动向客户端推送诊断结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PublishDiagnosticsParams {&#10;  uri: string;&#10;  version?: number;&#10;  diagnostics: Diagnostic[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Diagnostic {&#10;  range: Range;&#10;  severity?: DiagnosticSeverity;&#10;  code?: number | string;&#10;  codeDescription?: CodeDescription;&#10;  source?: string;&#10;  message: string;&#10;  tags?: DiagnosticTag[];&#10;  relatedInformation?: DiagnosticRelatedInformation[];&#10;  data?: unknown;&#10;}&#10;&#10;enum DiagnosticSeverity {&#10;  Error = 1,&#10;  Warning = 2,&#10;  Information = 3,&#10;  Hint = 4,&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PublishDiagnosticsParams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  uri</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  diagnostics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Diagnostic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Diagnostic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  range</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  severity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DiagnosticSeverity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  codeDescription</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CodeDescription</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tags</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DiagnosticTag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  relatedInformation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DiagnosticRelatedInformation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DiagnosticSeverity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  Error</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  Warning</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  Information</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  Hint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant E as 编辑器&#10;    participant S as 语言服务器&#10;&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/didOpen&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;S: 解析并分析文档&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;E: textDocument/publishDiagnostics&#10;    Note left of E: 在编辑器中显示波浪线&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/didChange&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;S: 增量重新分析&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;E: textDocument/publishDiagnostics&#10;    Note left of E: 更新诊断标记\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant E as 编辑器\n    participant S as 语言服务器\n\n    E-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/didOpen\n    S-&gt;&gt;S: 解析并分析文档\n    S-&gt;&gt;E: textDocument/publishDiagnostics\n    Note left of E: 在编辑器中显示波浪线\n    E-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/didChange\n    S-&gt;&gt;S: 增量重新分析\n    S-&gt;&gt;E: textDocument/publishDiagnostics\n    Note left of E: 更新诊断标记</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>严重程度</th>\n<th>值</th>\n<th>编辑器表现</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Error</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>红色波浪线</td>\n<td>语法错误、类型错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Warning</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>黄色波浪线</td>\n<td>未使用变量、隐式 any</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Information</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>蓝色波浪线</td>\n<td>代码风格建议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hint</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>淡色省略号</td>\n<td>可选的优化提示</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 推送模式下，发送空的 <code>diagnostics: []</code> 数组即表示清除该文档的所有诊断。关闭文档时务必清除。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"拉取模式-diagnostic-pull-model\">拉取模式（Diagnostic Pull Model）</h2><p>LSP 3.17 引入了拉取模式，由客户端按需请求诊断，而非服务端主动推送。拉取模式更适合大型项目和计算密集的诊断。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DocumentDiagnosticParams {&#10;  textDocument: TextDocumentIdentifier;&#10;  identifier?: string;&#10;  previousResultId?: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;type DocumentDiagnosticReport = RelatedFullDocumentDiagnosticReport | RelatedUnchangedDocumentDiagnosticReport;&#10;&#10;interface FullDocumentDiagnosticReport {&#10;  kind: &#39;full&#39;;&#10;  resultId?: string;&#10;  items: Diagnostic[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface UnchangedDocumentDiagnosticReport {&#10;  kind: &#39;unchanged&#39;;&#10;  resultId: string;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DocumentDiagnosticParams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  textDocument</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextDocumentIdentifier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  identifier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  previousResultId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DocumentDiagnosticReport</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RelatedFullDocumentDiagnosticReport</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RelatedUnchangedDocumentDiagnosticReport</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FullDocumentDiagnosticReport</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'full'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  resultId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Diagnostic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UnchangedDocumentDiagnosticReport</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'unchanged'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  resultId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    CLIENT[客户端请求诊断] --&gt; SERVER[服务端]&#10;    SERVER --&gt; CHECK{结果是否变更?}&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|是| FULL[&quot;返回 kind: &#39;full&#39;&lt;br/&gt;包含所有诊断项&quot;]&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|否| UNCHANGED[&quot;返回 kind: &#39;unchanged&#39;&lt;br/&gt;仅包含 resultId&quot;]&#10;    FULL --&gt; CACHE[客户端缓存 resultId]&#10;    UNCHANGED --&gt; REUSE[客户端复用上次结果]\">graph TD\n    CLIENT[客户端请求诊断] --&gt; SERVER[服务端]\n    SERVER --&gt; CHECK{结果是否变更?}\n    CHECK --&gt;|是| FULL[\"返回 kind: 'full'&lt;br/&gt;包含所有诊断项\"]\n    CHECK --&gt;|否| UNCHANGED[\"返回 kind: 'unchanged'&lt;br/&gt;仅包含 resultId\"]\n    FULL --&gt; CACHE[客户端缓存 resultId]\n    UNCHANGED --&gt; REUSE[客户端复用上次结果]</pre><p>两种模式对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>推送模式</th>\n<th>拉取模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触发方</td>\n<td>服务端主动</td>\n<td>客户端按需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络效率</td>\n<td>可能推送冗余</td>\n<td>支持 unchanged 优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>取消支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持 $/cancelRequest</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多文档支持</td>\n<td>逐文件推送</td>\n<td>支持 workspace diagnostic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引入版本</td>\n<td>LSP 1.0</td>\n<td>LSP 3.17</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>小项目、实时反馈</td>\n<td>大项目、计算密集</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 拉取模式的 <code>resultId</code> 实现了高效的增量更新——如果诊断未变化，服务端只需返回一个字符串标识而非完整列表。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"关联信息\">关联信息</h2><p>复杂的诊断错误往往涉及多个代码位置。<code>relatedInformation</code> 允许诊断项引用其他位置来提供额外上下文。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DiagnosticRelatedInformation {&#10;  location: Location;&#10;  message: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const diagnostic: Diagnostic = {&#10;  range: { start: { line: 10, character: 4 }, end: { line: 10, character: 8 } },&#10;  severity: DiagnosticSeverity.Error,&#10;  source: &#39;ts&#39;,&#10;  message: &quot;Type &#39;string&#39; is not assignable to type &#39;number&#39;.&quot;,&#10;  relatedInformation: [&#10;    {&#10;      location: {&#10;        uri: &#39;file:///src/types.ts&#39;,&#10;        range: { start: { line: 5, character: 2 }, end: { line: 5, character: 12 } },&#10;      },&#10;      message: &quot;The expected type comes from property &#39;count&#39; declared here.&quot;,&#10;    },&#10;  ],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DiagnosticRelatedInformation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  location</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Location</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> diagnostic</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Diagnostic</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  range: { start: { line: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, character: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, end: { line: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, character: </span><span style=\